        "created_at": "2015-02-14T15:11:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ahh yes, true, it does its damage at the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">start</span> of the turn…yeah, taht makes sense - hide for a round so the drones and EPE do nothing, then have a hero skip their turn so the Oxygen Leak murders everything when the environment's turn comes around. Cool :).</p>",
