        "id": 120281,
        "name": "mabenedi5488",
        "username": "mabenedi5488",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/dc4da7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-06T15:09:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a fun game against the Chairman with Knyfe, Captain Cosmic, Skyscraper and Naturalist. He managed to get us all down to about 3-5 hp before we get him to flip and at this point he still had the operative out. As cosmic I kept throwing out constructs to soak damage to the lowest hp, Knyfe (Promo) kept discarding the bottom card of the villain deck trying to pitch the jailbreak cause that would have been the game.Skyscraper managed to get the Link that deal irreducable damage to the character you put it on and one other target. We started putting it on the operative and having her attack the chairman and then the chairman retaliated against the first target who dealt him damage hitting the operative for more. We kept doing that until Operative was down and then just started putting that card on the Chairman himself so he dealt himself damage and then retaliatd against himself. Naturlist just kept healing himself to draw damage directed at the highest HP.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
