        "created_at": "2015-03-06T18:18:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I absolutely love this trick. Having tiny Sky bug both baddies until they rip each other's face was a perfect revenge for all these days in extensive care for poor defeated heroes.</p><p>In a game, today,&nbsp; Guise managed to collect Mad Bomber Blade's bombs and hide them in his briefcase - helped by his awesome physique (beefcake card). I didn't ask details. Blade, understandably, flipped.</p>",
