        "created_at": "2015-03-09T19:35:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just had a game last night with Cap Cosmic, Tempest, and Skyscrapper against Voss in the Dok-thorathian capital.&nbsp; We picked the game to be thematic to start with, but it ended with Tempest wiping the board of all Voss's minions and Skyscrapper in Huge form Uppercutting Voss, then choke slamming him and finally clapping to take him down.&nbsp; It felt very satisfying.</p>",
