      {
        "id": 120288,
        "name": "kreistor",
        "username": "kreistor",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9e8a1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-12T04:22:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The 03/10/2015 Handelabra fight was Spite in Atlantis. The team was winning very handily, but left him at 1 point for the environment turn.</p><p>The kraken's tentacles reached in, grabbed him by the neck and dragged him off into the depths. Classic comic book ending. The heroes walk away saying, \"There's no way he could survive that.\"</p><p>Wrong, of course... he'll be back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are looking for a thematic challenge, find three Legacy decks, and play the battle for Megalopolis. Legacy, America's Newest Legacy and World's Greatest Legacy vs Iron Legacy for Megalopolis.</p>",
