        "username": "Belle_Sorciere",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-18T00:07:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Had a game earlier where Ambuscade was defeated by one of his own sonic mines through the magic of redirection.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I did this once and I am still not clear on how it triggered a very long damage loop where Ambuscade kept damaging himself thanks to charged attacks. It was very satisfying, however.</p>",
