        "created_at": "2015-04-18T09:57:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Belle Sorciere\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Belle Sorciere:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I did this once and I am still not clear on how it triggered a very long damage loop where Ambuscade kept damaging himself thanks to charged attacks. It was very satisfying, however.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is a good example of one of the reasons that I'd like there to be a log in the game that one can refer to in order to see what happened.</p>",
