        "created_at": "2015-04-20T09:35:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kreistor\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9e8a1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kreistor:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The kraken's tentacles reached in, grabbed him by the neck and dragged him off into the depths. Classic comic book ending. The heroes walk away saying, \"There's no way he could survive that.\"Wrong, of course… he'll be back.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is fantastic, I love it when the game helps to turn itself into a story!</p>",
