      {
        "id": 120293,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-22T12:36:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Grand Warlord Voss in Wagner Mars, everyone low health, we lose our equips to dust, Wraith finds double deployment, Fixer plays Grease Gun and we get Voss down a bit lower. &nbsp;Oxygen leak comes into play.</p><p>So Voss's 11 minions come running in to save their leader, slip on the grease, and crash into the outside wall, breaking a hole in it and getting all of them and Voss horribly sucked into space.</p><p>We just skipped our turns. &nbsp;Figured we spent the time getting emergency oxygen masks and finding things to hold on to.</p>",
