        "created_at": "2015-04-27T19:24:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Awesome occurance today. &nbsp;Miss Information was being annoying, and we just had to wait her out so she would flip.</p><p>We ended up with massive hands, and when we realized she would flip PW Haka played a second Haka of Battle on Expatriette, and she played Hairtrigger, and everyone (Parse, Legacy) did everything they could to boost her damage, and on flip Expatriette dealt Miss Information 52 damage.</p>",
